<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36757" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξανά-στᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>removal, expulsion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.21.9
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>emigration,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινῶν ἐκ τῆς οἰκείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.3.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rising from bed to go to stool,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				11
			</span></i>; later simply, <i>going to stool,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.9
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Sever.
				<u>Clyst.</u>
				pp.3,34
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>rising from bed in the morning,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>VP</u>
				40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὕπνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					7.96
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐ. ἡ ἐκ νεκρῶν</span>
			<i>resurrection</i> from the dead, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Phil.</u>
				3.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> woman's
				<i>ornament</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				717.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
